    "Trending top 10 and Token Info percentages were taken from a signed-in GMGN Solana 1h Trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol (Trending tab, 1h, confirmed selected in trending.png) around 10:17 AM ET and checked against trending.png. price was not shown on the table (stored null). Token Info icons, confirmed on the screenshot: green-person % = top10Pct, red-rat/stack % = insiderPct, green-sniper/target % = sniperPct (last percentage chip on line 2, before Unpaid/CTO). Visible 0% values are stored as 0. Other Token Info chips (DS, lock, bundler/bot %, Unpaid, CTO, tax, and other unlabeled percentages) are not in this schema and were not stored as risk flags; no honeypot, mint, or freeze badges were visible on the top 10. token-info-crop.png was taken a few seconds later and had drifted slightly (e.g. row 1 insider 17% in the crop vs 16% in the main read); stored values follow the main trending.png read.",
