    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill — values were stored as shown, not sign-flipped. 122 distinct rows were captured across 48 token cards and 4 scroll steps; the board is virtualized and may have had more cards beyond the last scroll position. Same tickers with different mints were kept separate (two HELIA mints and three FLC mints). Two amounts displayed in K ($+3.27K, $+2.2K) were parsed to 3270 and 2200. No amount was unreadable.",
